<div class="page-head">
    <div class="eyebrow page-head__eyebrow">02 &mdash; Import</div>
    <h1 class="page-head__title">Change a PDF you already have.</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lead">An imported PDF comes back as the same objects you would have built yourself &mdash; pages, fonts, images, text. Which means modifying a document is the same work as making one, using the same API you already read on the last page.</p>
